OL,3,GNEWSACouncil plea to bin batteries
OL,4,Asafely after large fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is urging residents to
OL,7,Fdispose of batteries and
OL,8,Fbattery-powered items properly, after a
OL,9,Flarge fire at a recycling facility.
OL,11,FFifty firefighters tackled a blaze
OL,12,Fcaused by a battery at Total Metal
OL,13,FRecovery Ltd in Stoke Prior, near
OL,14,FBromsgrove on Tuesday.
OL,16,FWorcestershire County Council said the
OL,17,Ffire was the "latest warning" of the
OL,18,Fgrowing risks posed by batteries
OL,19,Fentering the waste and recycling
OL,20,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
